{
  "case": "P02 Anthropic × Messages models listed by ADR-0018 (claude-opus-4-8, claude-fable-5)",
  "source": "Synthetic offline fixture (issue 34). Expected requests follow pi-ai 0.87.1 (commit 898ab804050730e9dcefb4443875d5a932aa6a32) packages/ai/src/api/anthropic-messages.ts buildParams/convertMessages for an API key with the models' frozen anthropic.json data, except for the optional features barness does not implement (native mid-conversation tool changes, server-side fallback models), which follow pi's path with them off; the differences are ledger extensions (ADR-0018 决策四). Checked against frozen pi by the differential.",
